ns vary with the complexity of the model.\n\nThe library uses NVIDIA SimReady assets under CC BY 4.0. This independent experience is presented by Nebulytic.", "short_description": "Explore thousands of SimReady objects in mixed reality. Inspect their parts, change visual styles and experiment with physics.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/object-lab/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/object-lab/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Nebulytic", "support_website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/object-lab/support.html", "website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/object-lab/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1403638849498801"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1124393063502971"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1124393063502971"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1793392380, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1124393063502971"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1428748746987811", "version": "1.0.20"}, "id": "2416214928916043", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1403638822832137", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1428748746987811"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2416214928916043"}]}, "change_log": "\u201c+ Add .glb\u201d file picker.\r\n\u201cAll real\u201d and \u201cAll fit\u201d buttons.\r\nHollow cups and mugs.\r\nAn own-colour hologram look.\r\nBetter grabbing.", "created_date": 1794090113, "id": "1428748746987811", "version": "1.0.20", "version_code": 120, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 4}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1403638822832137", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1428748746987811"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2416214928916043"}]}, "change_log": "ObjectLab 1.0.18\n\nFIXED\n- One press no longer adds two copies of an object.\n- Exploded view: Push together puts every part back in its own place. Parts you took out return with the first press, and at 0 % the object is exactly as it was, even after physics moved its parts.\n- Objects open up by a similar distance in the exploded view.\n- The full model library (4.4 GB) now installs with the app.\n\nCHANGED\n- For Quest 3 and Quest 3S.\n\nSTILL HERE\n- Take parts out of the exploded view by hand, Tracer trails, menus that tilt to face you.\n\nModels: SimReady Assets, CC BY 4.0, modified. Not endorsed by NVIDIA.", "created_date": 1793493185, "id": "1410803802115639", "version": "1.0.18", "version_code": 118, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results